# Moblee vault: what git does not need to keep.
# Reports and renders are regenerated from the markdown; editor state and caches are noise.
outputs/*
# The weekly card is the exception. (v0.9.4) It is the only record that the
# owner was offered one that week, so if git does not hold it, a restore loses
# that memory and the owner is offered the same week's card again.
!outputs/weekly/
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
# What the assistant and the owner agreed to add, waiting for the Moblee app to
# add it. It is a queue the app empties, not a page, and leaving it untracked
# made every `git status` in the wiki look as though something were unsaved.
# The record beside it, .moblee/seed-state.json, IS kept: it says which starting
# notes the owner has taken out, so an update never puts one back.
.moblee/requests.json
